<title>FRANCE: ONIC reports free-market grain export bids.</title>
<headline>ONIC reports free-market grain export bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Feb 27 ---		 --- Feb 20 ---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  942,500  11.79-17.74	 952,500   15.67-21.47</p>
<p> Barley	212,000  26.48-30.98	 228,000   27.44-28.27</p>
<p> Durum wheat No bids			    5,000   Not given</p>
<p> Rye	   No bids			    No bids</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
